Issue with jquery remove method on IE7?

<table class="myCustomers">
 <tbody>
   <tr>
     <td>
       <ul id="salesCustomers">
       <li title="cust 1"><a id="cust_1" >customer 1</a></li>
       <li title="cust 2"></li>
       </ul>
     </td>
